{%- comment -%}
  "Descubre la gama completa" product grid — reused across UNDER, HOP
  subfamily pages, and LUXLIGHT (Phase 4G manager-review sprint).

  Renders ONLY via `product-grid-card` blocks — an explicit, curated list of
  real Shopify products (via a `type: "product"` block setting), one block
  per canonical PDP. This reads real product data (image, title,
  montibello.functional_subtitle, variant sizes) via the block's product
  reference, which resolves regardless of product status.

  Deliberately does NOT fall back to `collection.products` + Horizon's
  native `_product-card` once a collection gets real ACTIVE members (it did
  originally, and that path is still declared in the schema's `blocks` list
  and preset for backward compatibility, but is no longer reachable from
  this template — see below). That native path pulls in Horizon's default
  `price` block, which prints "S/. 0.00" for every Montibello product since
  none has a configured price yet, and its image crop/sizing is independent
  of `product-grid-card`'s fixed contain/frame styling — so a collection
  crossing from 0 to 1+ ACTIVE members silently produced a grid with a
  visible zero price AND inconsistent card sizes mixed into the same row.
  The curated path has neither problem and is the same "ONE consistent
  visual card system" everywhere regardless of product status, so it's now
  unconditional.

  The card blocks are rendered via `{% content_for 'blocks' %}`, not a
  manual `for block in section.blocks` loop reading `block.settings.*`
  directly — that manual-read pattern was the original implementation and
  was the actual bug behind the range grids showing the empty-catalog
  fallback for every product-grid-card block: this block type lives in a
  separate file under blocks/ (a theme block), and theme blocks need
  Shopify to be asked to render them via content_for before their settings
  reliably resolve. `content_for 'blocks'` handles a variable-length,
  merchant-ordered block list without needing a literal id.

  The "heading" block is rendered separately, above the grid, via the
  singular `content_for 'block', type: 'text', id: 'heading'`. That call
  is Shopify's documented API for a single *static* block — which requires
  the block's JSON entry to carry `"static": true` and be omitted from
  `block_order` (see the 5 collection.*.json templates). Without that
  `"static": true` flag, "heading" was a normal dynamic block being
  addressed as if it were static, which is unsupported and part of why
  the grid area below it also never resolved correctly.

  Falls back to a plain "no products configured yet" note only if no
  product-grid-card blocks are configured, so this section never renders an
  empty grid shell.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div
  class="section section--{{ section.settings.section_width }} montibello-product-range spacing-style"
  style="{% render 'spacing-style', settings: section.settings %}"
>
  <div class="montibello-product-range__header">
    {% content_for 'block', type: 'text', id: 'heading' %}
  </div>

  {% liquid
    assign grid_card_count = 0
    for block in section.blocks
      unless block.id == 'heading'
        assign grid_card_count = grid_card_count | plus: 1
      endunless
    endfor
  %}

  {% if grid_card_count > 0 %}
    <div class="montibello-product-range__grid">
      {% content_for 'blocks' %}
    </div>
  {% else %}
    <p class="montibello-product-range__note">{{ section.settings.placeholder_note }}</p>
  {% endif %}
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .montibello-product-range__header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .montibello-product-range__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem 1rem;

    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }

  .montibello-product-range__card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .montibello-product-range__image-wrap {
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--color-background-secondary, #ece7dc);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .montibello-product-range__image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .montibello-product-range__image-placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--color-background-secondary, #ece7dc);
  }

  .montibello-product-range__name {
    font: var(--font-heading--style) var(--font-heading--weight) var(--font-size--sm) / 1.3 var(--font-heading--family);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .montibello-product-range__type {
    font-size: var(--font-size--xs);
    opacity: 0.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .montibello-product-range__sizes {
    font-size: var(--font-size--xs);
    opacity: 0.55;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .montibello-product-range__note {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: var(--font-size--xs);
    opacity: 0.6;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  /* FULL-SITE PARITY (official /gama/hop/hop-repair/, 1440): left-aligned
     40/40 heading on the 1300px container, 248px-wide cards 20px apart,
     white 248x346 canvases, 12px tracked eyebrow, 23/21/700 name, 16/19.7
     subtitle and 0.5px-outlined size pills. */
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .montibello-product-range:has(.montibello-product-range__card--official) {
      .montibello-product-range__header,
      .montibello-product-range__grid {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 1300px;
        margin-inline: auto;
      }

      .montibello-product-range__header {
        padding-inline: 0;
      }

      .montibello-product-range__header {
        text-align: left;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .montibello-product-range__header :is(h1, h2, h3) {
        font-size: 40px;
        line-height: 40px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        color: #000;
        text-align: left;
        margin: 0;
      }

      /* official cards run 20px past the heading's left edge (x=43 vs 63),
         which is what lets five 248px cards sit on one row */
      .montibello-product-range__grid {
        max-width: 1340px;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, 248px);
        gap: 20px;
        justify-content: start;
      }
    }
  }

  .montibello-product-range__card--official {
    gap: 0;
    color: #000;
  }

  .montibello-product-range:has(.montibello-product-range__card--official) {
    background-color: rgb(246, 246, 243) !important;
  }

  .montibello-product-range__card--official .montibello-product-range__image-wrap {
    aspect-ratio: 248 / 346;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .montibello-product-range__card--official .montibello-product-range__image {
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .montibello-product-range__eyebrow {
    margin: 20px 0 0;
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.11em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .montibello-product-range__card--official .montibello-product-range__name {
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    font-size: 23px;
    line-height: 21px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .montibello-product-range__card--official .montibello-product-range__type {
    margin: 10px 0 0;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 19.7px;
    font-weight: 500;
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .montibello-product-range__pills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    margin: 33px 0 0;
  }

  .montibello-product-range__pill {
    min-width: 121px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    border: 0.5px solid #767676;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-size: 13.6px;
    line-height: 28px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* mobile (official, 390): left-aligned 35/35 heading, two 15px-gutter columns */
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .montibello-product-range:has(.montibello-product-range__card--official) {
      .montibello-product-range__header {
        text-align: left;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .montibello-product-range__header :is(h1, h2, h3) {
        font-size: 35px;
        line-height: 35px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        color: #000;
        text-align: left;
        margin: 0;
      }

      .montibello-product-range__grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 30px 15px;
      }
    }

    .montibello-product-range__pill {
      min-width: 0;
      flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 3px);
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Gama de productos",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-wrapper",
  "blocks": [
    { "type": "text" },
    { "type": "product-grid-card" }
  ],
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "section_width",
      "label": "Ancho de sección",
      "options": [
        { "value": "page-width", "label": "Ancho de página" },
        { "value": "full-width", "label": "Ancho completo" }
      ],
      "default": "page-width"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "placeholder_note",
      "label": "Nota cuando no hay productos configurados",
      "default": "Catálogo completo disponible próximamente en Montibello Perú."
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-start",
      "label": "Superior",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 64
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding-block-end",
      "label": "Inferior",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 1,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 64
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Gama de productos",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Descubre la gama completa</h2>",
            "type_preset": "h2",
            "alignment": "center",
            "width": "100%"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": ["heading"]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
